{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09482","headline":"白沙亭逢吴叟歌 · 韦应物","name":"白沙亭逢吴叟歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"龙池宫里上皇时，罗衫宝带香风吹。\n满朝豪士今已尽，欲话旧游人不知。\n白沙亭上逢吴叟，爱客脱衣且沽酒。\n问之执戟亦先朝，零落艰难却负樵。\n亲观文物蒙雨露，见我昔年侍丹霄。\n冬狩春祠无一事，欢游洽宴多颁赐。\n尝陪月夕竹宫斋，每返温泉灞陵醉。\n星岁再周十二辰，尔来不语今爲君。\n盛时忽去良可恨，一生坎壈何足云。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09482.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09482","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}